Every account, contact, ticket, note, usage record, and external event in this
repository is SYNTHETIC. The dataset is generated by the code in `dataset/` from
a fixed seed and describes no real company, no real person, and no real
commercial relationship. Names that resemble real organisations are coincidental
products of the generator's word banks.

The system is read-only decision support. It produces advisory forecasts and
routes what it is unsure of to a human reviewer. It takes no action on any
customer, sends no message, and changes no record outside its own application
memory.
